but, look,
this is the only opportunity we have.

258
00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:32.371
Fuck that. No way. I'll do this one alone.

259
00:14:36.417 --> 00:14:38.043
You know what your problem is, Kai?

260
00:14:38.627 --> 00:14:40.880
