384
00:22:31.683 --> 00:22:33.518
[Tommy] Oh, um... [sucks teeth]

385
00:22:33.602 --> 00:22:37.689
So I was actually here five years ago,
and someone stole my Louis V backpack.

386
00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:40.275
They took my wallet,
passport, phone, everything.

387
