405
00:23:33.078 --> 00:23:35.372
All right. I'll take care of it.

406
00:23:35.455 --> 00:23:38.333
No. Tomorrow, we're all going.
We're gonna get Jenny's killer together.

407
00:23:38.417 --> 00:23:39.751
Hey! Yo!

408
