522
00:29:36.983 --> 00:29:38.902
[grunting]

523
00:29:40.779 --> 00:29:41.779
Hyah!

524
00:29:41.821 --> 00:29:42.821
[yells]

525
00:29:43.656 --> 00:29:45.784
