- Yeah. Of course it is.

526
00:29:48.536 --> 00:29:49.579
[Kai sighs]

527
00:29:50.455 --> 00:29:52.457
[Kai coughs, sneezes]

528
00:29:53.082 --> 00:29:55.126
- [exhales]
- [both grunt]

529
00:29:56.544 --> 00:29:59.839
Ah, fuck. Who the fuck did this?

530
00:30:00.507 --> 00:30:02.675
