560
00:31:22.797 --> 00:31:26.384
[elevator dings multiple times]

561
00:31:29.804 --> 00:31:32.098
[grunting]

562
00:31:32.181 --> 00:31:33.181
[yells]

563
00:31:34.225 --> 00:31:36.936
["Monsoon Rock"
by Amyl and The Sniffers playing]

564
00:31:40.189 --> 00:31:41.189
[grunts]

565
00:31:41.983 --> 00:31:45.236
<i>♪ It's a Thursday morning
I am sleeping in my home town ♪</i>

566
00:31:45.320 --> 00:31:48.197
<i>♪ I can see
I can see the sky from the clouds ♪</i>

567
00:31:48.281 --> 00:31:51.367
<i>♪ The rain was falling down
And we're all begging it to stop ♪</i>

568
00:31:51.451 --> 00:31:54.537
<i>♪ Instead we're gonna do
The monsoon rock ♪</i>

569
00:31:56.497 --> 00:31:57.497
[yells]

570
00:31:59.667 --> 00:32:00.877
[bones crack]

571
00:32:01.878 --> 00:32:02.878
[yells]

572
00:32:03.630 --> 00:32:04.630
[grunts]

573
